    # MC @ talk "I only mentioned it because 美嘉 has asked me to persuade you to give her the same affection as you give the others."
    MC @ talk "我提及此事只是因为美嘉请求我说服您，给予她与其他女孩同等的关爱。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/GirlTroubles/src_GirlTroubles.rpy:118
